ong>次<span class=\"red\">重庆</span>　深度解锁千里江山</div>\n      <div class=\"line2\">3D魔幻网红打卡+小众人文建筑+地道小吃</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"time\">时间</th>\n          <th>线路</th>\n          <th class=\"food\">吃</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"rowshort\">\n          <td class=\"day\">第1天</td>\n          <td class=\"route\">\n            <span class=\"star\">☀</span> <b>三峡博物馆（重庆大礼堂）</b> <span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>解放碑<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>八一好吃街<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>能仁寺<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>左营天桥<br>\n            <span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span><b>罗汉寺·摩崖石刻</b><span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>朝天门<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"mark\">来福士/WFC观景台（2选1）</span> <span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>魁星楼<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"green\">洪崖洞</span>·夜景<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>千厮门大桥\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"food\"></td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"rowshort\">\n          <td class=\"day\">第2天</td>\n          <td class=\"route\">\n            <span class=\"star\">☀</span> <b>马鞍山堂堂</b> <span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span><b>中山四路文化街区</b><span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>城外停车 <span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span><b>鹅岭公园</b><span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>鹅岭二厂<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>李子坝<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>磁器口古镇<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>北仓文创园<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"green\">不夜九街</span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"food\"></td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"rowthird\">\n          <td class=\"day\">第3天</td>\n          <td class=\"route\">\n            <span class=\"star\">☀</span> <b>山城第三步道</b> <span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>十八梯<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>白象居<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>湖广会馆<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>东水门城墙<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>过长江索道<br>\n            道/两江环江游轮（2选1）<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>龙门浩老街<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>弹子石老街<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>南滨游艇广场<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"green\">南山一棵树</span>·夜景\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"food\"></td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"day4cell\">\n            <div class=\"day4badge\">第<br>4<br>天</div>\n            <div class=\"vertical\">可<br>根<br>据<br>情<br>况<br>替<br>换<br>！</div>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"day4route\">\n            <div class=\"tour-title\"><span class=\"star\">☀</span> <b>渣滓洞白公馆</b><span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>磁器口古镇<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>好军房湾七彩巷<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span><b>罗中立美术馆</b><span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span><span class=\"star\">☀</span> <b>黄桷坪涂鸦一条街</b><span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>交通茶馆<span class=\"route-arrow\">→</span>铁路四村</div>\n\n            <div class=\"section\">\n              <div class=\"tour-title\"><span class=\"green\">▼渣滓洞白公馆景区</span></div>\n              <div class=\"desc\"><span class=\"dot\">◉</span> 9:00-16:30 网上实名预约</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">烈士墓、渣滓洞、白公馆 任选专线专车，每人20元</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section\">\n              <div class=\"tour-title\"><span class=\"green\">▼渣滓洞</span></div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">原为人工开采小煤窑，1920年由资本家程昌所建，后被策被军统所霸占改造成监狱。</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section\">\n              <div class=\"tour-title\"><span class=\"green\">▼白公馆</span></div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">原为四川军阀白驹郊外别墅，白驹自诩是白居易的后台，</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">1939年军统特务头子戴笠，改造为逮捕革命家的监狱</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section\">\n              <div class=\"tour-title\"><span class=\"orange\">▼磁器口古镇</span></div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">商业化严重，但是可以一看</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">重庆非常有名的古镇，感受这座城市历史和古韵，还有各种各样的小吃，</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section\">\n              <div class=\"tour-title\"><span class=\"orange\">▼马房湾七彩巷（网红打卡）</span></div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">童话世界中的彩色王国，房子都被涂成了五颜六色，明星涂鸦墙</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section\">\n              <div class=\"tour-title\"><span class=\"green\">▼罗中立美术馆</span></div>\n              <div class=\"desc\"><span class=\"dot\">◉</span> 9:30-16:30（周一闭馆）免费 微信“四川美院美术馆”预约</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">川美黄桷坪校区，面积最大美术馆，旁边是大学城有名黑街</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section\">\n              <div class=\"tour-title\"><span class=\"mark\">▼黄桷坪涂鸦一条街</span></div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">川美黄桷坪校区 这条街上从楼房、墙面、树枝、店铺等满满的涂鸦</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section\">\n              <div class=\"tour-title\"><span class=\"orange\">▼交通茶馆</span></div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">一杯茶10元 黄桷坪正街4号</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">始于1987年，保持上世纪七八十年代风格，水泥地面、红砖柱头、四方桌、条凳、青</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">花瓷碗，喝茶聊天了怀旧味道扑面</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section\">\n              <div class=\"tour-title\"><span class=\"green\">▼铁路四村</span></div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">废弃的铁轨上长满了绿色植物，瞬间掉入宫崎骏动画的感觉</div>\n              <div class=\"desc\">有一家军哥书屋的二手书店。</div>\n            </div>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"food\"></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
